          "content": "## Email cache → Unified List sheet\nDaily at 6:41 AM ET.\n\n1. Creates the `email_verification_cache` tab if it's missing.\n2. Reads the **Unified List - email verification cache** data table.\n3. Clears the tab and writes a full snapshot (newest checks first).\n\nThe tab is a mirror — edits made there get overwritten on the next run.",
